re is Billy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How do I get in the mansion?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who/what is the groundskeeper?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is happening in the tower?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is the professor up to?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What do the video messages mean?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why are there runes everywhere?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So many secrets. And this is just the beginning\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/7584b3e0150f017e0039a1fa9e997522.poster.avif?t=1727828938\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/7584b3e0150f017e0039a1fa9e997522.webm?t=1727828938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/7584b3e0150f017e0039a1fa9e997522.mp4?t=1727828938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has both narrative mysteries and puzzles. Some puzzles are contextual, while others are standalone or artifact-based. You will have to use most of your senses. Chris\u2019s thoughts act as a guide, but you may find yourself led forward by a mysterious entity -- one goading you to complete objectives.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is connected for a reason. It\u2019s up to you to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/7aaf4e1550db6517d66b676c8a20e12c.poster.avif?t=1727828938\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/7aaf4e1550db6517d66b676c8a20e12c.webm?t=1727828938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/7aaf4e1550db6517d66b676c8a20e12c.mp4?t=1727828938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of fog-filled atmospheric environments, unique monsters, and visceral, suspense-filled gameplay. Players will juggle between cerebral puzzles while watching their backs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/29efd6f1ae9ee915d28ccd8905509ea6.poster.avif?t=1727828938\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/29efd6f1ae9ee915d28ccd8905509ea6.webm?t=1727828938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/29efd6f1ae9ee915d28ccd8905509ea6.mp4?t=1727828938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy throughout the game will present a different behavior that the player will have to adapt to. Some see you, some hear you, some feel you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its immersive single-player experience and gripping horror atmosphere, The Kharzov Effect promises a thrilling adventure that will keep you on the edge of your seat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228900/extras/8125b39858910b85d2756e981aa5918c.avif?t=1727828938\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to The Kharzov Effect, an immersive first-person puzzle horror game. Explore Dr. Kharzov\u2019s eerie estate as you unravel the mystery behind a series of abductions. Face terrifying creatures, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover the truth of Kharzov's dark history!",
